{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) x<sup>2</sup> - 3x - 1 = 0 হলে (x<sup>2</sup> - 1/x<sup>2</sup>) এর মান-", "option1": "ক) 3&radic;13", "option2": "খ) 13&radic;3", "option3": "গ) 3&radic;5", "option4": "ঘ) 5&radic;3", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - 3x - 1 = 0<br />বা, (x<sup>2</sup> - 3x - 1)/x = 0<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup>/x - 3x/x - 1/x = 0<br />বা, x - 1/x = 3<br /><br />এখন, (x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> = (x - 1/x)<sup>2</sup> + 4.x.1/x<br />বা, (x + 1/x)<sup>2 </sup>= 3<sup>2</sup> + 4 = 13<br />বা, x + 1/x = &radic;13<br /><br />&there4; x<sup>2</sup> - 1/x<sup>2 </sup>= (x + 1/x)(x - 1/x)<br />=&nbsp;&radic;13.3<br />= 3&radic;13</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x<sup>2</sup> = 100 হলে, x<sup>-3</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 0.1", "option2": "খ) 0.01", "option3": "গ) 0.001", "option4": "ঘ) 0.0001", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> = 100<br />&there4; x = 10<br />এখন,<br />x<sup>-3</sup> = 1/x<sup>3</sup><br />= 1/10<sup>3</sup><br />= 1/1000<br />= 0.001</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) x + y = 2 এবং x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> = 8 হলে, x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 4", "option3": "গ) 6", "option4": "ঘ) 8", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x + y = 2 এবং x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> = 8<br /><br />x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> = 8<br />বা, (x + y)<sup>3</sup> - 3xy(x + y) = 8<br />বা, 2<sup>3</sup> - 3xy.2 = 8<br />বা, - 6xy = 0<br />&there4; xy = 0<br /><br />x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup><br />= (x + y)<sup>2</sup> - 2xy<br />= 2<sup>2</sup> - 2.0<br />= 4</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) a + b = -c হলে a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> এর মান-", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) abc", "option3": "গ) 2abc", "option4": "ঘ) 3abc", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>a + b = -c<br />&there4; a + b + c = 0<br /><br />এখন, a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup><br />= a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> - 3abc + 3abc<br />= (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> - ab - bc - ca) + 3abc<br />= 0 &times; (a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> - ab - bc - ca) + 3abc<br />= 3abc&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) x = 2 + &radic;3 হলে, x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 8 + 3&radic;3", "option2": "খ) 52", "option3": "গ) 8 - 3&radic;3", "option4": "ঘ) 50", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>যেহেতু, x = 2 + &radic;3<br />&there4; 1/x = 2 -&nbsp;&radic;3<br />&there4; x + 1/x = 4<br /><br />এখন, x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup><br />= (x + 1/x)<sup>3</sup> - 3.x.1/x(x + 1/x)<br />= 4<sup>3</sup> - 3.4<br />= 64 - 12<br />= 52</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 5 এবং x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> = 3 হলে, x<sup>4</sup> + y<sup>4</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 15", "option2": "খ) 8", "option3": "গ) 16", "option4": "ঘ) 17", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x<sup>4</sup> + y<sup>4</sup><br />= (x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + (y<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup><br />= 1/2 [2{(x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + (y<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>}]<br />= 1/2 [{(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + (x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>}]<br />= 1/2 [5<sup>2</sup> + 3<sup><span>2</span></sup>]<br />= 1/2&nbsp;&times; 34<br />= 17</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) a - [a - {a - (a + 1)}] = ?", "option1": "ক) -1", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) a + 1", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>a - [a - {a - (a + 1)}]<br />= a - [a - {a - a - 1}]<br />= a - [a - {-1}]<br />= a - [a + 1]<br />= a - a - 1<br />= -1</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) (3 - x)/(x - 2) এর সাথে কত যোগ করলে যোগফল 1/(x - 2) হবে?", "option1": "ক) -1", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>1/(x - 2) - {(3 - x)/(x - 2)}<br />= (1 - 3 + x)/(x - 2)<br />= (x - 2)/(x - 2)<br />= 1</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) 0.01 &times; 0.1 = ?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 0.1", "option3": "গ) 0.01", "option4": "ঘ) 0.001", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>0.01 &times; 0.1<br />= 0.001</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) (1 - 1/a<sup>2</sup>) &divide; (1/a + 1) = ?", "option1": "ক) a/(a - 1)", "option2": "খ) (a - 1)/a", "option3": "গ) a(a - 1)", "option4": "ঘ) a(a + 1)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>(1 - 1/a<sup>2</sup>)&nbsp;&divide; (1/a + 1)<br />= (1 - 1/a<sup>2</sup>)/(1/a + 1)<br />= {(1 + 1/a)(1 - 1/a)}/(1 + 1/a)<br />= 1 - 1/a<br />= (a - 1)/a</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) (x + 7) এবং (x - 6) এর গুণফল-", "option1": "ক) x<sup>2</sup> + x - 42", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup> - 42", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup> - x - 42", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> + x + 42", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>(x + 7)(x - 6)<br />= x<sup>2</sup> + 7x - 6x - 42<br />= x<sup>2</sup> + x - 42</p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) x<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup>y, x<sup>2</sup>y + xy<sup>2</sup> এর গ.সা.গু = ?", "option1": "ক) x(x + y)", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup>(x + y)", "option3": "গ) xy(x + y)", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup>y(x + y)", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>প্রথম রাশি, x<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ x<sup>2</sup>y<br />=&nbsp;x<sup>2</sup>(x + y)<br />দ্বিতীয় রাশি, x<sup>2</sup>y + xy<sup>2<br /></sup>= xy(x + y)<br /><br />&there4; গ.সা.গু =&nbsp;x(x + y)</p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) a + b, a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup>, a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> এর ল.সা.গু = ?", "option1": "ক) (a - b)(a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup>)", "option2": "খ) (a - b)(a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup>)", "option3": "গ) (a + b)(a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup>)", "option4": "ঘ) (a + b)(a<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;- b<sup>3</sup>)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>প্রথম রাশি, a + b = (a + b),<br />দ্বিতীয় রাশি, a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup> = (a + b)(a - b),<br />তৃতীয় রাশি, a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> = (a + b)(a<sup>2</sup> - ab + b<sup>2</sup>)<br /><br />&there4; ল.সা.গু = (a + b)(a - b)(a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- ab + b<sup>2</sup>)<br />=&nbsp;(a - b)(a<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>3</sup>)</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) a(a - b)/(a + b) কে (a - b)/(a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup>) দ্বারা ভাগ করলে ভাগফল কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) a<sup>2</sup>(a<sup>2</sup> - ab + b<sup>2</sup>)", "option2": "খ) a(a<sup>2</sup> - ab + b<sup>2</sup>)", "option3": "গ) a<sup>2</sup>(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)", "option4": "ঘ) a(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>a(a - b)/(a + b)&nbsp;&divide;&nbsp;&nbsp;(a - b)/(a<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>3</sup>)<br />= {a(a - b)/(a + b)} &times; {(a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup>)/(a - b)}<br />= {a(a - b)/(a + b)} &times; {(a + b)(a<sup>2</sup> - ab + b<sup>2</sup>)/(a - b)}<br />= a(a<sup>2</sup> - ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) 1/(x + 1) এর মান নিচের কোনটি হওয়া অসম্ভব?", "option1": "ক) -1", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 2/3", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>যদি 1/(x + 1) = 0 হয়,<br />তবে 1 = 0 হয় যা অসম্ভব,<br />&there4; 1/(x + 1) &ne; ০</p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) 1/x<sup>3</sup> এর লব ও হরের সাথে কোন একই বীজগাণিতিক রাশি যোগ করলে যোগফল  -{1/(x<sup>2</sup> + x)} হয়।", "option1": "ক) x", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) -x", "option4": "ঘ) -1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>1/x<sup>3</sup> এর লব ও হরের সাথে -x যোগ করে পাই,<br />(1 - x)/(x<sup>3</sup> - x)<br />= -(x - 1)/{x(x<sup>2</sup> - 1)}<br />= - (x - 1)/{ x(x + 1)(x - 1)}<br />= - {1/(x<sup>2</sup> + x)}</p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) 2/(&radic;5 + &radic;3) এর সমান-", "option1": "ক) &radic;5 + &radic;3", "option2": "খ) 1/(&radic;5 + &radic;3)", "option3": "গ) &radic;5 - &radic;3", "option4": "ঘ) 1/(&radic;5 - &radic;3)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>2/(&radic;5 +&nbsp;&radic;3)<br />= 2(&radic;5 - &radic;3)/{(&radic;5 + &radic;3)(&radic;5 - &radic;3)} [লব ও হরের সাথে (&radic;5 - &radic;3) গুণ করে]<br />= 2(&radic;5 - &radic;3)/{(&radic;5)<sup>2</sup> - (&radic;3)<sup>2</sup>}<br />= 2(&radic;5 - &radic;3)/(5 - 3)<br />= 2(&radic;5 - &radic;3)/2<br />= &radic;5 - &radic;3</p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) (a + 2)(a - 2) কে (a + 3)(a - 3) দিয়ে ভাগ করলে ভাগশেষ কত?", "option1": "ক) -5", "opti